      "review_description": "I took 6 months to decide on a new solar / battery installation, getting quotes from a number of providers. Eventually i settled on Darwin Solar, based on the information the sales rep provided.Installation was quick and easySince the system has been installed, i have noticed an issue whereby the battery randomly charges from the grid. This mainly occurs on cloudy days. I have tried to get this resolved or find out why the battery charges from the grid for over two months, with only token responses from both Darwin Solar and Sungrow. They have no interest in providing a resolution or response.At the present time, consumer affairs have been engaged due the the lack of after sales service.I would not recommend to anyone these providers due to their lack of after sales service.",
